	(text "- Pin numbers follow the Black Pill table [verify]\n- PB2 is BOOT1 and must read low (R201)\n- PA9/PA10 on the program port, SWD on J202 (3V3 sense via R203)\n- PB6/PB7 = I2C1 (TCA9555); NRF_CE PC14, NRF_IRQ PB1, HOST_OC PC15\n- PA0 is the board KEY button; never use the Black Pill USB-C with the USB-A host"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 144.78 153.67 0)
		(effects
